# prefix-cycle — шаги записи (что показывается — prefix-cycle.md)
# Список Prefix стартового набора: # … #####, 1., (пусто), -. Move right идёт вниз по нему, Move left — вверх.
open Prefix cycle.md
caret bread
say Default: Move right turns plain text into a bullet…
cmd move-right
expect - milk / - bread / eggs
say …and after the last marker it indents the line
cmd move-right
expect - milk / 	- bread / eggs
caret eggs
say Move left goes the other way: numbered, then a heading
cmd move-left
expect - milk / 	- bread / 1. eggs / butter
cmd move-left
expect - milk / 	- bread / ##### eggs / butter

say After the last one → Start over
settings Navigation
set After the last one = Start over
caret bread
say Move right → after the bullet it starts over from #
cmd move-right
expect - milk / - bread / eggs
cmd move-right
expect - milk / # bread / eggs

say Cycle in both directions → off
settings Navigation
set Cycle in both directions = off
caret bread
say Move right → plain text stays as it is
cmd move-right
cmd move-right
expect - milk / bread / eggs
say Move left still changes the marker
cmd move-left
expect - milk / 1. bread / eggs
